cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this artifact, please cite the DLS 2026 paper and this repository."
title: "Precision Accounting for KV and Recurrent-State Caches in Hybrid LLM Serving (artifact)"
abstract: >-
  Verification and reproduction artifact for a byte-exact accounting study of
  attention KV cache and recurrent-state memory in hybrid LLM serving. Contains
  the frozen allocator-run evidence, the dependence-aware GSM8K reanalysis, the
  fail-closed selector audit, and the figure/data verifier used by the paper.
